<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-040" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-040-zilin" source-id="s-nanqishu-040-zilin-ws2272748">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-040-zilin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">南康王<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zilin:p001:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed_B">子琳</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zilin:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_B">雲璋</persName>，世祖第十九子也。母<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zilin:p001:m0018" ref="xon_sxb_cqq">荀氏</persName>，盛寵。<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zilin:p001:m0024" ref="kix_r92_2ed_B">子琳</persName>鍾愛。永明七年，封宣城王。明年，上改南康公<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zilin:p001:m0047" ref="jyx_72x_8t2_A">褚蓁</persName>以封<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zilin:p001:m0051" ref="kix_r92_2ed_B">子琳</persName>。永泰元年，見殺。年十四。</p>
</text>
